te=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b9c2b3bb904b3813\" href=\"?note=b9c2b3bb904b3813\" title=\"88-df-representable-function\">88-df-representable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a72f024d8daeb569\" href=\"?note=a72f024d8daeb569\" title=\"88-df-substitution\">88-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0aa80b611d62ec1b\" href=\"?note=0aa80b611d62ec1b\" title=\"88-df-classical-calculus\">88-df-classical-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"f5c5e5f1b0bfe9f6\" href=\"?note=f5c5e5f1b0bfe9f6\" title=\"88-lem-numeral-functional-representation\">88-lem-numeral-functional-representation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (candidate theory extending PA, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"111244cddc854123\" href=\"?note=111244cddc854123\" title=\"./88-df-peano-arithmetic\">88-df-peano-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (Peano arithmetic axiom set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\">\\(\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\\)</span> (proof rule and coding)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,x\">\\(\\varphi,x\\)</span> (candidate formula and distinguished variable)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{diag}_{g,x}\">\\(\\operatorname{diag}_{g,x}\\)</span> (code-level diagonal substitution function)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{idx}(v_i)=i\">\\(\\operatorname{idx}(v_i)=i\\)</span> (variable-index map)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,R}(\\operatorname{diag}_{g,x})\">\\(\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,R}(\\operatorname{diag}_{g,x})\\)</span> (representability condition)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"0aa80b611d62ec1b\" href=\"?note=0aa80b611d62ec1b\" title=\"88-df-classical-calculus\">88-df-classical-calculus</a>；对角化使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"f5c5e5f1b0bfe9f6\" href=\"?note=f5c5e5f1b0bfe9f6\" title=\"88-lem-numeral-functional-representation\">88-lem-numeral-functional-representation</a> 的逐输入唯一输出表示。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；变量编号使用本签名固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i^S\">\\(v_i^S\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{diag}_{g,x}\">\\(\\operatorname{diag}_{g,x}\\)</span> 以下述图定义，调用的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sub}_g\">\\(\\operatorname{sub}_g\\)</span> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a> 中共同固定的数据相同。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{idx}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle v_i^S,i\\rangle:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\\operatorname{idx}:\\mathrm{Var}_S\\to\\mathbb N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{idx}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle v_i^S,i\\rangle:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\\operatorname{idx}:\\mathrm{Var}_S\\to\\mathbb N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\quad\n\\operatorname{diag}_{g,x}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle n,m\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2:\n\\langle\\langle n,\\operatorname{idx}(x),n\\rangle,m\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{sub}_g\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\quad\n\\operatorname{diag}_{g,x}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle n,m\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2:\n\\langle\\langle n,\\operatorname{idx}(x),n\\rangle,m\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{sub}_g\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\\land\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\land\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,R}(\\operatorname{diag}_{g,x})\n\\land\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\nT\\vdash_R\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\varphi[\\nu_S(g(\\psi))/x]\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\\land\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\land\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,R}(\\operatorname{diag}_{g,x})\n\\land\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\nT\\vdash_R\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\varphi[\\nu_S(g(\\psi))/x]\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>的Gödel数 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li>对角化引理是构造自引用句子的核心技术</li>\n<li>也称为&quot;自引用引理&quot;或&quot;固定点引理&quot;</li>\n<li>固定点中代入的是数词<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{g(\\psi)}\">\\(\\overline{g(\\psi)}\\)</span>，而非元层数字<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(\\psi)\">\\(g(\\psi)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>表示对角代入函数这一条件被显式列出；仅有任意单射编码并不足以推出引理。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{idx}(v_i)=i\">\\(\\operatorname{idx}(v_i)=i\\)</span>把变量对象转成代入函数所需的自然数索引。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"56061e16f3fb8bfd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"